# PromQL: Prometheus documentation: Querying basics, operators and functions; requirements/languages/promql.md
name     promql
keyword  by without on ignoring group_left group_right offset bool and or unless sum avg min max count
keyword  stddev stdvar topk bottomk quantile count_values
builtin  rate irate increase delta deriv histogram_quantile abs ceil floor round sort time vector
builtin  scalar label_replace absent clamp_min clamp_max avg_over_time sum_over_time
line-comment   #
string   " "  : escapes
string   ' '  : escapes
string   ` `
key-names  =~!
operators  +-*/%^=!<>~{}[]
calls
